# F19 v2: commit one verified placed box with an explicit container_link
# slot pose (slot profile: box center, box_axis_pi, scene basis) and
# measured provenance. The v1 AddPlacedBox world-pose shape stays for the
# ROS1 orchestrator and normalizes through the same single ledger entry.
luggage_msgs/PoseContractV2 slot_pose
float64[3] size_wdh
string measured_source
uint64 expected_map_revision
string geometry_hash
---
bool success
string message
uint64 resulting_map_revision
